  "releaseNotes": "Icod.Terminal 1.14.0 adds side-effect-free persistent-raster lifecycle observability through atomic Current/Stale/Released/Disposed ownership snapshots and semantic loss/release reasons, preserving opaque protocol identities, independent resource/placement lifetime, and no-replay semantics. Release notes: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/main/docs/releases/1.14.0.md. Compatibility policy: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/main/docs/Compatibility-and-Versioning.md.",
